	(text "Slot 6: A2, antenna port card.\nRF position 1 (b2+b3) = ANT2. Positions 2 to 6 not connected: every antenna card is identical.\nSLOT_ID3..0 = 0110: a 0 bit is strapped to GND, a 1 bit is open (pull-up on the card).\nPins b20 to b32 and all other unlabelled contacts: see pin-out on the root sheet."
